OL,3,GNEWSABaby loss mural remembers 157
OL,4,Ababies and families
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby loss charity has unveiled a
OL,7,Fmural at its headquarters with 157
OL,8,Fnames with each representing "a baby, a
OL,9,Fstory and a family we are honoured to
OL,10,Fknow".
OL,12,FLuna's Fund was founded in 2018 by two
OL,13,Fparents after the loss of their
OL,14,Ffirst-born daughter Luna.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
