OL,3,GNEWSABaby loss mural remembers 157
OL,4,Ababies and families
OL,5,
OL,6,FAimee Green, founder and chief
OL,7,Fexecutive officer of the charity based
OL,8,Fin Longbridge Road, Plymouth, Devon,
OL,9,Fsaid: "Being able to walk into the
OL,10,Foffice everyday and see the babies who
OL,11,Finspire us and all of the families that
OL,12,Fwe've known to support over the past
OL,13,Fseven years is the most motivational
OL,14,Fpart of our jobs."
OL,16,F"We want to thank you for letting us
OL,17,Fwalk with you on your journeys and for
OL,18,Fhonouring all of these special babies."
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
